  "title": "Recruit SMARTER: Setting Adaptive Recruitment Goals",
  "summary": "To optimize the recruitment process, educational institutions need to set clear and effective goals. In this blog post, we introduce a new acronym, SMARTER, to guide districts in setting recruitment goals that are Specific, Measurable, Achievable, Relevant, Time-bound, Evaluated, and Revised.",
